# Motion Design Standards

Build MotionSites-quality animation natively — no paid prompt libraries.

## Stack
- **Framer Motion** — scroll reveals, hero parallax, hover states, stagger
- **Lenis** — smooth scroll (respect `prefers-reduced-motion`)
- **CSS** — grain overlays, gradients, Ken Burns fallback

## Tokens (`src/lib/motion.ts`)
- Easing: `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`
- Stagger: 70–80ms between siblings
- Scroll reveal: `translateY(36px)` → `0`, duration ~1.1s, `viewport.once`

## Patterns
- Hero: `useScroll` + `useTransform` for parallax image scale/Y; word-stagger headline
- Stats: spring-animated counters on `useInView`
- Cards: image scale on hover, description fade/slide up
- Marquee: Framer infinite `x` animation
- Split sections: parallax image tied to `scrollYProgress`

## Components
Reuse: `Reveal`, `HeroSection`, `TextReveal`, `AnimatedStat`, `ServiceCard`, `WorkTile`, `ParallaxSplit`, `Marquee`, `MotionButton`

## Brand
Obsidian `#07090c`, gold `#c9a84c`, cream `#f5f0e1`, Cormorant Garamond + DM Sans
